From 89b600dcca2ff33abde2550d9b300bc8d8cb7ebf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nicolas Le Bayon <nicolas.le.bayon@st.com>
Date: Tue, 5 Jul 2022 16:00:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 179/954] fix(st-ddr): phy: adjust phyvref for DDR3

Set Vref at 50% to increase efficiency.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git cba6888492d0d8ee97f0651b9671cff1e6bc3a3e fix(st-ddr): phy: adjust phyvref for DDR3]
Signed-off-by: Nicolas Le Bayon <nicolas.le.bayon@st.com>
Change-Id: I730642b521d26dd64c0026ad3d10f538728fefb9
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/259464
Reviewed-by: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
---
 drivers/st/ddr/phy/phyinit/src/ddrphy_phyinit_initstruct.c | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/st/ddr/phy/phyinit/src/ddrphy_phyinit_initstruct.c b/drivers/st/ddr/phy/phyinit/src/ddrphy_phyinit_initstruct.c
index 08bae4d205..a63e1d0285 100644
--- a/drivers/st/ddr/phy/phyinit/src/ddrphy_phyinit_initstruct.c
+++ b/drivers/st/ddr/phy/phyinit/src/ddrphy_phyinit_initstruct.c
@@ -69,10 +69,17 @@ void ddrphy_phyinit_initstruct(void)
 					 * Set cspresent[3]   = 1 (if CS3 is populated with DRAM)
 					 * Set cspresent[7:4] = 0 (Reserved; must be set to 0)
 					 */
+#if STM32MP_DDR3_TYPE
+	uint8_t phyvref = 0x40U;	/*
+					 * Use Analytical VREF and Compensate for T28 Attenuator,
+					 * see PHY databook
+					 */
+#else
 	uint8_t phyvref = 0x56U;	/*
 					 * Use Analytical VREF and Compensate for T28 Attenuator,
 					 * see PHY databook
 					 */
+#endif /* STM32MP_DDR3_TYPE */
 	uint8_t dfimrlmargin = 0x01U;	/* 1 is typically good in DDR3 */
 #if STM32MP_DDR3_TYPE
 	uint8_t addrmirror = 0x00U;	/*
-- 
